# Everything under state/ is generated per-run (wizard answers, detection results,
# validation output, the staged MCP probe). None of it belongs in the repo - a
# user-config.json checked in here would get silently picked up by `install.ps1
# -SkipInteractive` on a fresh clone, install-state.json only reflects whoever last
# ran the wizard, and the MCP probe SDK is reinstalled fresh every run anyway.
state/

node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
